    "shepherdInspectionFacts": " Inspection technicians lost: {0}.",
    "shepherdRepairFacts": " Cargo delivered: {0}. Shore power restored: {1}. Turret constructed this sortie: {2}. Repair technicians lost: {3}.",
    "shepherdPassageLosses": " Cooperative militia lost: {0}.",
    "shepherdPassageTerms": "Road repair, construction and defended militia handover in exchange for Morrow and willing working crew after the hull clears the basin. The cooperative retains the Colossus, its shipment and the yard. No departure cash fee. ",
    "shepherdColdTerms": "22,000 credits for cargo escort and repair cover. Morrow remains cooperative property. ",
    "shepherdSalvageTerms": "18,000 credits for yard clearance and inspection. Cooperative militia hold the outer road; Morrow remains cooperative property. ",
    "shepherdPassageDeployment": "Company shuttles carry your selected squads. Company shuttles drop the machines in your bay. Eight cooperative militia hold the prepared road positions. ",
    "shepherdInspectionDeployment": "Company shuttles carry your selected squads and drop the machines in your bay. Eight cooperative militia and two inspection technicians support the operation. ",
    "shepherdColdDeployment": "Your selected squads begin on the secured receiving apron; company shuttles stay in reserve and drop the machines in your bay. Fourteen cooperative militia support the operation: eight inner holders and two three-person outer pickets. Two technicians accompany the repair party. ",
    "shepherdColdForceRequirement": "{0} squads and {1} mechs or vehicles recommended, one of them heavy; two squads with at least four ready marines each required. The rival crew still holds the pump work site with hired guns and dug-in ship guns. Four road teams come for the build ground, hired guns among them: the quarry team brings a mortar carrier and a rocket technical, and the last team up the south haul road brings a technical and a tank. ",
    "shepherdPassageForceRequirement": "{0} squads and {1} mechs or vehicles recommended, one of them heavy; two squads with at least four ready marines each required. Each watch on Morrow''s route is dug in with hired guns and a ship gun. Four road teams come at the passage, hired guns among them: the quarry team brings a rocket technical, and the last team up the south haul road brings a technical and a tank. ",
    "shepherdSalvageForceRequirement": "{0} squads and {1} mechs or vehicles recommended, one of them heavy; two squads with at least four ready marines each required. A rival crew holds the yard in strength: hired guns beside the scrappers in every building, ship guns dug in round the cradle and the workshop, point defence cut from the wreck, two technicals, a dozer, a salvaged Warden and two of Morrow''s own drones. Once you reach the cradle their reserve comes up the south haul road behind a technical and a tank. Land rockets and anti-armour weapons, not rifles alone. ",
    "shepherdColdReplacementParty": "Confirmed repair crew losses: {0}. A replacement party is assigned. ",
