    "boatFittingStandardHold": "Passenger hold",
    "boatFittingStandardHoldProvenance": "Benches, straps and a ramp: the hold a shuttle leaves the yard with, for people.",
    "boatFittingLiftCradle": "Lift cradle",
    "boatFittingLiftCradleProvenance": "A clamped cradle goes in under the deck, rated for a light frame. The benches fold against the walls when she carries one.",
    "boatFittingHeavyCradle": "Heavy cradle",
    "boatFittingHeavyLiftFrame": "Heavy lift frame",
    "boatFittingHeavyLiftFrameProvenance": "A lifting frame bolted through the keel to the drive mounts, rated for a heavy machine. She will carry a Bulwark; whether she carries it quickly is up to her drive.",
    "boatFittingStandardCabin": "Courier cabin",
    "boatFittingStandardCabinProvenance": "The seats the hull was built with, and a ramp. On a Hermes that is twelve: one whole squad, three fire teams along the walls.",
    "boatFittingStandardEmitter": "Low-tech shield",
    "boatFittingStandardEmitterProvenance": "The shield the Hermes was built with: an orange low-tech field, 120 degrees, that turns every point it stops into a point of flux. Enough to keep debris off a courier.",
    "boatFittingWideEmitter": "Midline shield",
    "boatFittingWideEmitterProvenance": "A midline projector ring: a teal field over 180 degrees that spends less flux on what it stops.",
    "boatFittingAssaultEmitter": "High-tech shield",
    "boatFittingAssaultEmitterProvenance": "A high-tech field emitter: a blue shield over 240 degrees that turns a hit into far less flux than a courier's ever could.",
    "boatFittingStandardPower": "Courier capacitors",
    "boatFittingStandardPowerProvenance": "The flux plant the hull came with. Enough for the shield on a quiet run; not much more.",
    "boatFittingCapacitorBank": "Capacitor bank",
    "boatFittingCapacitorBankProvenance": "Half again the flux she can hold before the shield drops, packed into what used to be stowage.",
    "boatFittingMilitaryCapacitors": "Military capacitors",
    "boatFittingMilitaryCapacitorsProvenance": "Military capacitors and a vent array: a deeper pool that empties faster, so she can keep shooting with the shield up.",
    "boatFittingHeavyCradleProvenance": "A cradle on a reinforced keel, with the ramp rebuilt to take a medium frame. Heavier than anything the hull was drawn to carry.",
    "boatGunHeavyMg": "Heavy machine gun",
    "boatGunHeavyMgEffect": "Wide cone · suppresses troops in the open",
    "boatGunHeavyMgProvenance": "A pintle gun on a ring, belt-fed from a box under the seat. Every shuttle yard keeps a crate of them, which is why every small shuttle carries one.",
    "boatGunArbalest": "Arbalest autocannon",
    "boatGunArbalestEffect": "Steady fire · punches light cover and vehicles",
    "boatGunArbalestProvenance": "The fleet's small-mount autocannon on a door ring. Heavier than the hull likes, and worth it the first time somebody fires back from a technical.",
    "boatGunGrenadeLauncher": "Grenade launcher",
    "boatGunGrenadeLauncherEffect": "Lobbed rounds · clears trenches and windows",
    "boatGunGrenadeLauncherProvenance": "A drum-fed launcher that arcs its rounds over whatever the crew below are hiding behind. Slow, and hard to argue with.",
    "boatGunHephaestus": "Hephaestus assault gun",
    "boatGunHephaestusEffect": "Heavy rounds · breaks hard points",
    "boatGunHephaestusProvenance": "An assault gun meant for a frigate's turret, bolted to a shuttle by a yard that was paid not to ask. The deck plates around the ring need replacing after every sortie.",
    "boatGunTwinPe1": "Twin PE-1 pulse emitter",
    "boatGunTwinPe1Effect": "Fires on flux · no magazine · quick bursts",
    "boatGunTwinPe1Provenance": "A hover scout's twin pulse emitter on a door ring: two Wisp emitters throwing bright energy bolts you can watch fly, not a laser. It never runs dry, so long as the capacitors keep up.",
    "boatGunPl3": "PL-3 pulse laser",
    "boatGunPl3Effect": "Fires on flux · accurate bursts · tracks fliers",
    "boatGunPl3Provenance": "The laser tank's PL-3, cut down for a shuttle's ring. It shoots at anything that flies, including what is shooting at her.",
    "boatGunSrm15": "SRM-15",
    "boatGunSrm15Effect": "Three salvos a sortie · hits hard on the run in",
    "boatGunSrm15Provenance": "A pintle rack of short-range missiles. Three salvos and she is empty until the deck crew reloads her, so the pilots save it for the landing zone.",
    "boatGunLrm10": "LRM-10",
    "boatGunLrm10Effect": "Two long salvos a sortie · reaches far out",
    "boatGunLrm10Provenance": "A rail rack of long-range missiles that lets her open on a gun line before it can see her. Two salvos, then a long walk to the magazine.",
