    "squadDoctrineBuildersGuardWeaponsDescription": "Holding a construction site out of the Shepherd yard stores: three sappers with satchel charges and two DEP-PD-GUNs over the plots.",
    "squadDoctrineFieldFatiguesArmorName": "Watchman's Kit",
    "squadDoctrineFieldFatiguesArmorDescription": "Whatever the station had, organised the way a band organises itself.",
    "squadDoctrineSindrianSecurityArmorName": "Diktat State Security Issue",
    "squadDoctrineSindrianSecurityArmorDescription": "Security contracts, run as a line section because that is the drill they were taught.",
    "squadDoctrineHegemonyAuxiliaryArmorName": "Hegemony Auxiliary Schedule",
    "squadDoctrineHegemonyAuxiliaryArmorDescription": "Auxiliary sections keep the Hegemony's shape on a fraction of its issue.",
    "squadDoctrineLeagueMobileArmorName": "League Mobile Guard Standard",
    "squadDoctrineLeagueMobileArmorDescription": "A coalition screen that expects to move and to be seen doing it.",
    "squadDoctrineChurchWardenArmorName": "Church Parish Warden Kit",
    "squadDoctrineChurchWardenArmorDescription": "Parish wardens hold a place; they do not go out looking for one.",
    "squadDoctrineOutlawRaiderArmorName": "Blackforge Raider Lot",
    "squadDoctrineOutlawRaiderArmorDescription": "A raiding band: everybody fights, two carry the heavy thing, nobody scouts for long.",
    "squadDoctrineReconArmorName": "Tri-Tachyon Recon Package",
    "squadDoctrineReconArmorDescription": "Corporate operators, weighted toward the half of the section that is paid to see.",
    "squadDoctrineFleetCombatArmorName": "Hegemony Line Schedule",
    "squadDoctrineFleetCombatArmorDescription": "The standard section, and what every other composition is measured against.",
    "squadDoctrineLeagueLineArmorName": "League Coalition Line Standard",
    "squadDoctrineLeagueLineArmorDescription": "Interchangeable by design, so a member world can replace any billet in it.",
    "squadDoctrineCorporateLineArmorName": "Tri-Tachyon Response Package",
    "squadDoctrineCorporateLineArmorDescription": "A response section: quick, well-sighted, and unwilling to stand and trade.",
    "squadDoctrineChurchLineArmorName": "Church Commissary Line Kit",
    "squadDoctrineChurchLineArmorDescription": "Commissary-approved kit, and a section that intends to still be there afterwards.",
    "squadDoctrineSindrianLineArmorName": "Diktat Regular Line Issue",
    "squadDoctrineSindrianLineArmorDescription": "A conspicuous advance, which is most of the point of it.",
    "squadDoctrineOutlawLineArmorName": "Blackforge Veteran Lot",
    "squadDoctrineOutlawLineArmorDescription": "Veterans of a trade that rewards volume and speed over anything else.",
    "squadDoctrineFreeportAssaultArmorName": "Freeport Militia Assault Kit",
    "squadDoctrineFreeportAssaultArmorDescription": "Militia plate and two cargo frames: cheap, square-shouldered and in the field this week.",
    "squadDoctrineHegemonyShockArmorName": "Hegemony XIV Shock Schedule",
    "squadDoctrineHegemonyShockArmorDescription": "A deliberate breach: two teams through the door and one making the hole bigger.",
    "squadDoctrineCorporateHeavyArmorName": "Tri-Tachyon Specter Package",
    "squadDoctrineCorporateHeavyArmorDescription": "The same breach, bought from a company that sells prediction rather than plate.",
    "squadDoctrineLeagueHeavyArmorName": "League Bulwark Breach Standard",
    "squadDoctrineLeagueHeavyArmorDescription": "Coalition breach formations, built so the marine beside you need not be from your navy.",
    "squadDoctrineKnightsHeavyArmorName": "Knights' Armoury Heavy Issue",
    "squadDoctrineKnightsHeavyArmorDescription": "A Knight crosses the room in front of somebody else, and the section is arranged around that.",
    "squadDoctrineLionsGuardHeavyArmorName": "Lion's Guard Mantle Issue",
    "squadDoctrineLionsGuardHeavyArmorDescription": "Prestige issue: allotted by political favour, and fielded where the regime wants it seen.",
    "squadDoctrineOutlawHeavyArmorName": "Foundry-Breaker Rig Lot",
    "squadDoctrineOutlawHeavyArmorDescription": "Industrial rigs pointed at a door by people with no formal doctrine at all.",
