		"debriefReliefCostClean": "It's nice to be getting paid again. Crew pay and supplies first and the rest goes to the company account for equipment, repairs, and upgrades for you to decide Commander.",
		"debriefJangalaRoad": "The convoy is through, and the road to the star port is ours again. We can fulfill our shipping contracts again, Commander.",
		"debriefJangalaManifests": "One thing in my report I can't leave alone, Commander. Every ambush on that corridor sat on the loads worth taking and let the rest go by. Somebody knew what Wayline Industrial Cooperative was carrying.",
		"debriefJangalaWhy": "I've been over it all night: the lost sailings, the depot, the junction. Somebody knew our business better than we did, and I still can't tell you who. But I have a lead on someone off-world, on Asharu, who might.",
		"debriefJangalaNext": "That closes our pressing work on Jangala. There's repeat contract work here if we want it, but we can move on to Asharu. When the company's in order, we go in with the next drop.",
