    "openingRefitPathSTEADY_LINE": "Steady Line",
    "openingRefitPathFORWARD_SCREEN": "Forward Screen",
    "openingRefitPathDescriptionSTEADY_LINE": "Learn Milspec MG-SUPP automatics. Three gunners anchor nine riflemen. The refit includes the Hegemony auxiliary protection sheet: ARM-SEC-2-LN plate and ARM-LUDD-2-SUPP aid kit.",
    "openingRefitPathDescriptionFORWARD_SCREEN": "Learn Milspec AR-PULSE rifles and ARM-TACH-2-RCN scout suits. Six pulse rifles and five scout billets trade line protection for eyes and mobility. The refit includes the League mobile protection sheet: ARM-TACH-2-RCN scouts with ARM-LUDD-2-SUPP and ARM-INDP-2-ASLT support kit.",
    "openingCompanyOfficerName": "Castle",
    "marines_management_musterTitle": "Look after the company",
    "marines_management_musterText": "Barracks is where we look after our people. Loadout on a squad's card changes its kit; Raise Squad musters a new squad under the selected officer.",
    "marines_management_woundedTitle": "Read the muster",
    "marines_management_woundedText": "Each card shows ready, wounded and vacant places. The wounded keep their billets and are back on duty after a day aboard; the clock at the top says when.",
    "marines_management_replenishTitle": "Fill the gaps",
    "marines_management_replenishText": "The wrench fills empty places: on a card for that squad, beside Select All for every selected squad. I enlist Marines from cargo, one per empty place. Hover a wrench to see what it needs.",
    "marines_management_readyTitle": "Back to work",
    "marines_management_readyText": "Check the muster before the next job. Missions takes you back to work; Return leaves the ship. Company Guide opens this walkthrough again.",

