    "workshopRestorationReclaimingCopy": "The line sorts every part we bring back down to stock. Try what you like on the shuttles and machines; whatever does not work out is paid back in full.",
    "workshopRestorationNextInstallReclamationLine": "NEXT: Install a reclamation line. Recycled spares and scrapped machines return their whole bill.",
