    "workshopRestorationInstallLine": "INSTALL LINE",
    "openingWorkshopRestorationThatHatchStaysShutTheYardCan": "That hatch stays shut. The yard can clear the fallen ribs and plate the breach. Then we can see what the machines need.",
    "openingWorkshopRestorationThePatchIsHoldingAndTheFloor": "The patch is holding and the floor is ours again. Now we can mend those broken machines and put this room back to work.",
    "openingWorkshopRestorationSheWorksGiveTheHandsProperTooling": "She works. Give the hands proper tooling and they will waste less keeping our shuttles and machines ready, and the yard bills will come down.",
