		"defenceReportColourTOXIC": "The check-ins came through rebreathers, every word half static.|Survivors say the haze was thick enough to hide a lander until it was down.|The air scrubbers on the post ran hot the whole night.",
		"defenceReportColourAIRLESS": "There was no sound out there, only the shudder of the deck through the boots.|Every report came in sealed-suit flat, all breath and no echo.|Landing flares hung in the black longer than they had any right to.",
		"defenceReportColourSTORM": "The storm took the first wave of sensor contacts and gave them back all at once.|Rain came sideways across the post the whole time.|Lightning lit the landing zone better than our flares did.",
		"defenceReportColourHEAT": "Heat shimmer over the wire made every shape a raider.|The check-ins were short; nobody wasted water on talk.|Weapons had to be swapped out before they cooked.",
		"defenceReportColourCOLD": "Frost on the optics, breath freezing in the comms grilles.|The cold kept the landing slow, which was the only kindness of the night.|Survivors say the snow drowned out the engines until the landers were close.",
		"defenceReportColourTEMPERATE": "It was an ordinary night until the landing lights came on.|The first warning was dogs barking in the settlement below.|The post watch logged the drop as weather until it fired back.",
		"defenceReportColourUNKNOWN": "The relay carried the whole thing in fragments.|Word reached the company late and in pieces.",
		"defenceReportCloserHELD": "The post stands. The flag never came down.|Quiet again by morning. The watch went back to cards.|The relay signed off with a single word: holding.",
		"defenceReportCloserHELD_WITH_LOSSES": "The post stands. It cost more than anyone wanted to pay.|The relay went quiet for an hour before the casualty list came through.|They held. Nobody on the channel sounded pleased about it.",
		"defenceReportCloserOVERRUN": "The relay ended in static.|The last transmission was a grid reference and nothing after it.|Nothing more came through after that.",
		"defenceReportCloserTURNED": "The landers never touched down. The watch stood down at dawn.|The engines faded off the scopes before dawn.|A long night of waiting for nothing, which is the best kind.",
