		"warrantObligationTermsStated": "{0} military warrant terms: take no contract against {0}, and keep the relationship at the floor the warrant sets. Each {1}-day period kept is honoured.",
		"warrantObligationSuspendedLoyalty": "{0} military warrant suspended: its loyalty term was broken. None of its cards may be acquired or given to another squad until a {1}-day period passes with the relationship restored.",
