	"agreusGuidePrepWater": "Vale's departure reference, forwarded by Zoey. Two squads, fitted shuttles and an owned working tender required. Replenish before leaving Corvus; no deadline.",
	"agreusGuidePrepWarrant": "Review Dormer's bounded procurement warrant. Two squads, fitted shuttles and a working tender. Protect the supplier and bring the calibration load back. No deadline or yard agreement.",
	"agreusGuidePrepYard": "Three full squads recommended, fitted shuttles and working tender. Hold three sites and protect the tooling inspection. Optional owned mech; no bombardment.",
	"agreusGuideHandoverOpen": "DECISION / Latchkey custody agreements",
